 dialogue:{title:"Antes de la junta de inversionistas", scene:"Sebastián, analista de una gestora de fondos en Medellín, prepara con su jefa Rachel la presentación trimestral para los clientes.", a:"Rachel", b:"Sebastián", lines:[
  ["A","Right, Sebastián, walk me through the macro picture before we get to the portfolio.","Bueno, Sebastián, explícame el panorama macro antes de entrar al portafolio."],
  ["B","Headline inflation has eased to 6.1%, but core inflation is proving stubborn at around 7%.","La inflación total bajó a 6,1 %, pero la inflación básica se mantiene terca alrededor del 7 %."],
  ["A","So the central bank is unlikely to cut rates any time soon.","O sea que es poco probable que el banco central recorte tasas pronto."],
  ["B","Most analysts expect it to keep rates on hold until the second quarter. A further rate hike can't be ruled out, either.","La mayoría de analistas espera que mantenga las tasas hasta el segundo trimestre. Tampoco se descarta otra subida."],
  ["A","How has that played out in the bond market?","¿Cómo se ha reflejado eso en el mercado de bonos?"],
  ["B","Local bond yields are up about fifty basis points since January, which has hit our fixed-income fund quite hard.","Los rendimientos de los bonos locales han subido unos cincuenta puntos básicos desde enero, lo que ha golpeado bastante a nuestro fondo de renta fija."],
  ["A","And equities?","¿Y la renta variable?"],
  ["B","Mixed. Banks have done well, but the retail sector is in bear market territory after several companies posted losses.","Mixta. A los bancos les ha ido bien, pero el sector comercio está en terreno bajista después de que varias empresas registraran pérdidas."],
  ["A","What about the cement company we're overweight in?","¿Y la cementera en la que estamos sobreponderados?"],
  ["B","Revenue was up 9% year-on-year, but they took a write-down on a plant in Central America, so earnings missed expectations.","Los ingresos subieron 9 % interanual, pero registraron un deterioro de una planta en Centroamérica, así que las utilidades no cumplieron las expectativas."],
  ["A","Did they revise their guidance?","¿Revisaron sus proyecciones?"],
  ["B","They lowered it slightly, though the balance sheet remains solid and liquidity isn't a concern.","Las rebajaron ligeramente, aunque el balance sigue sólido y la liquidez no es una preocupación."],
  ["A","Clients will ask whether we're heading for stagflation. What's our line?","Los clientes van a preguntar si vamos hacia una estanflación. ¿Cuál es nuestra postura?"],
  ["B","That growth is slowing, not stalling. We'd stress that volatility is likely to persist and that a diversified portfolio is the best hedge against it.","Que el crecimiento se está desacelerando, no estancando. Recalcaríamos que la volatilidad probablemente persistirá y que un portafolio diversificado es la mejor cobertura contra ella."],
  ["A","Good. Keep the jargon to a minimum, though. Half of them won't know a basis point from a bullet point.","Bien. Pero reduce la jerga al mínimo. La mitad no distingue un punto básico de una viñeta."],
  ["B","Noted. I'll add a one-page glossary at the end, just in case.","Entendido. Agrego un glosario de una página al final, por si acaso."]
 ]},
